  "misconceptions": [
    "Believes fractions can be ordered by comparing numerators and denominators independently without finding a common denominator",
    "Assumes the fraction with the largest numerator is always the largest value regardless of the denominator",
    "Fails to recognize that a larger denominator results in smaller parts when numerators are different"
